📡 agentctl — tmux based agent multiplexer

Usage: agentctl [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  help       Show usage information
  list       List tmux panes running agent harness processes
  install    Install agentctl on a harness
  uninstall  Uninstall agentctl from a harness
  agent      Manage agent state
  info       Print agentctl's runtime paths and metadata

Options:
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level for the log file: trace, debug, info, warn, or error (default: info). Does not affect stdout/stderr output [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn, error]
  -h, --help               Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version            Print version
